00:13:36.900 --> 00:13:39.570
You're amazing Miyabi! You know so much!

00:13:39.570 --> 00:13:40.560
We just learned something!

00:13:40.640 --> 00:13:43.040
I... I knew that!

00:13:43.040 --> 00:13:45.030
I know this, too!

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:47.240
Men are pointy and here I come!

00:13:47.240 --> 00:13:50.840
Women are soft and meow-meow!

00:13:51.110 --> 00:13:52.080
Really?!

00:13:52.350 --> 00:13:54.510
I kind of thought that, too.

00:13:54.850 --> 00:13:58.810
Anyway! It's dangerous that you
guys have these secret passageways.

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:02.890
It might be best to check out all
of them throughout the mansion.

00:14:03.060 --> 00:14:04.250
Yes sir!
Yes sir!

00:14:04.460 --> 00:14:07.120
Stop taking charge!

00:14:07.800 --> 00:14:11.390
Go, my sons! Defeat Miyabi!

00:14:12.070 --> 00:14:13.630
How dare you do that to my precious necklace!

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:17.300
Two-person briefs!

00:14:17.470 --> 00:14:19.100
Miyabi's out of control!

00:14:19.480 --> 00:14:21.030
Stop! I apologize!

00:14:21.280 --> 00:14:25.770
You're a no-good-ninja,
getting lost in a secret passageway!

00:14:25.980 --> 00:14:28.650
You're just as bad as the
instant yakisoba leftovers...

00:14:28.650 --> 00:14:32.310
...stuck in the drain after
I empty the hot water!

00:14:32.860 --> 00:14:34.120
That bad?!

00:14:34.820 --> 00:14:36.120
Now, now...

00:14:36.190 --> 00:14:40.720
Moving on... just don't go into a
strange passageway if you find one.

00:14:40.860 --> 00:14:41.960
Okay!
Okay!

00:14:41.960 --> 00:14:44.300
Make sure you be careful! Okay?

00:14:44.300 --> 00:14:45.490
Okay!
Okay!

00:14:45.800 --> 00:14:48.570
How do you like that? You be careful, too.

00:14:48.570 --> 00:14:54.580
You're so clumsy, you'd get stuck
in a passageway in five seconds.

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:56.480
No, I'm not!

00:14:56.480 --> 00:14:57.680
Take that!

00:14:57.680 --> 00:14:59.870
Onsoku is being mean!

00:15:01.180 --> 00:15:02.840
Wait for me!

00:15:05.190 --> 00:15:06.160
It's a hidden passageway!

00:15:06.160 --> 00:15:08.720
It won't open! Shinobu! Shinobu!

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:10.850
Sister!

00:15:12.430 --> 00:15:14.290
Huh? Huh??

00:15:14.960 --> 00:15:16.330
Where am I?

00:15:17.770 --> 00:15:20.960
Interrupting our current program,
we bring you breaking news.

00:15:21.070 --> 00:15:26.140
The world class super duo,
On-chan & Shinobu-chan, seem to have...

00:15:26.140 --> 00:15:30.870
...unknowingly wandered into
a secret passageway.

00:15:32.650 --> 00:15:35.080
Calm down! Be careful of the traps!

00:15:35.220 --> 00:15:38.380
Don't touch the walls unnecessarily!

00:15:39.090 --> 00:15:41.110
The exit! Where's the exit?!

00:15:42.560 --> 00:15:44.420
A handy rope?

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:46.590
Oh, no!

00:15:48.560 --> 00:15:51.370
What is this? This is too... This is too much!

00:15:51.370 --> 00:15:52.230
An army of ants is coming at you!
What is this? This is too... This is too much!

00:15:52.230 --> 00:15:53.100
An army of ants is coming at you!

00:15:54.570 --> 00:15:57.270
Move your hand from that stone!

00:15:57.870 --> 00:16:00.470
It was my fault? I'm sorry!

00:16:01.910 --> 00:16:04.670
There are star candies on the floor!

00:16:05.150 --> 00:16:07.480
Damn it... There are traps everywhere.

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:10.650
Damn predecessors.
Making all these useless traps!

00:16:11.920 --> 00:16:15.980
