while being careful about the traps!

00:16:16.260 --> 00:16:19.660
It's a mission that will test your ninja skills!

00:16:20.130 --> 00:16:23.000
Got it! I'll do my best!

00:16:23.170 --> 00:16:25.760
But, I'm going to rest before we begin.

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:28.530
A mayonnaise trap on the seat?!

00:16:28.940 --> 00:16:30.230
Another trap?!

00:16:34.580 --> 00:16:36.580
The horrors of a vacuum trap!

00:16:36.580 --> 00:16:36.950
It can't be!
The horrors of a vacuum trap!

00:16:36.950 --> 00:16:37.600
It can't be!

00:16:39.180 --> 00:16:40.710
What a beautiful day.

00:16:41.050 --> 00:16:43.540
I have a feeling something
good is going to happen.

00:16:44.690 --> 00:16:45.750
Located the exit!

00:16:45.750 --> 00:16:46.020
Asa Sho(Pi~!)!
Located the exit!

00:16:46.020 --> 00:16:46.920
Asa Sho(Pi~!)!

00:16:49.760 --> 00:16:52.190
Shinobu... Onsokumaru...

00:16:56.100 --> 00:16:57.900
Sounds like it was a pain...

00:16:58.200 --> 00:17:01.660
Anyway! This mansion is full of hidden dangers!

00:17:01.770 --> 00:17:06.280
If you think it's suspicious,
don't do anything stupid! Got it?

00:17:06.280 --> 00:17:07.540
Okay!
Okay!

00:17:07.540 --> 00:17:09.030
